Release 0.2.0.

Changelog: 17-10-2026 12:01:38

Fixed. The app's folder in the suite is apps/decky (was apps/decky-manager) and its package is decky_manager (was
bc250_decky_manager): the suite's naming convention (owner, 17-10-2026), a short folder name and the package named
after the app without the BC-250 prefix; both names are the owner's. With the folder go its key in the portal, its
chapter of the wiki (apps/decky/, which the Manual button opens), its installer test and its release tags:
decky-v<x.y.z> from the next release on, which the app's update check follows. The installed app keeps its name,
its launcher bc250-decky-manager, its folder under ~/.local/share, its settings and state, and the Decky pin in
loader.py; the portal moves its record of the installed copy to the new key.

